  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "The Scene class acts as the root context and primary manager for the entire 3D environment within the ECS pattern. It orchestrates the lifecycle, managing collections of SceneEntity objects, lights, and scene-specific effects like fog. It provides critical methods for state persistence via serialization (toJsonObject/fromJson) and controls the main update/draw loop, delegating rendering to the RenderPipeline."
  },
